1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,900
Flump! Where is Pip?

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,643
Guess!

3
00:00:06,643 --> 00:00:09,430
I see two brown ears!

4
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,152
Ta-da! I'm a snow puppy!

5
00:00:13,152 --> 00:00:13,915
Hee hee!

6
00:00:14,465 --> 00:00:15,800
Shake, shake, shake!

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,542
Shake off the snow with me!

8
00:00:19,142 --> 00:00:21,793
Now sing the Snow Slide Song,

9
00:00:21,793 --> 00:00:23,035
and copy us!

10
00:00:24,735 --> 00:00:25,654
Up, up,

11
00:00:25,654 --> 00:00:27,584
up the hill we go.

12
00:00:27,834 --> 00:00:30,641
March your feet in the snow!

13
00:00:31,241 --> 00:00:32,846
Sit down, hold on,

14
00:00:32,846 --> 00:00:34,145
feet in front.

15
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:35,933
Hold on tight!

16
00:00:36,533 --> 00:00:39,279
One, two, three, and wheee!

17
00:00:39,529 --> 00:00:41,394
Arms up high!

18
00:00:41,994 --> 00:00:43,465
My turn, your turn,

19
00:00:43,465 --> 00:00:44,936
fun for you and me!

20
00:00:46,836 --> 00:00:47,895
Arms up high!

21
00:00:47,895 --> 00:00:48,490
Wheee!

22
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:50,794
Share with a friend and

23
00:00:50,794 --> 00:00:52,958
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

24
00:00:53,458 --> 00:00:55,026
Watch the full story

25
00:00:55,026 --> 00:00:56,595
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
